    UI Specification for Left Sidebar Map Toolbar
General Sidebar Styling:

Theme: Dark mode. Background color is a very dark grey/near-black (e.g., #151515 or #1a1a1a).

Text Color: Primary text is off-white or light grey.

Font: Sans-serif, clean and modern (similar to Inter or Roboto).

Layout: Fixed width sidebar on the left side of the screen, vertically scrollable.

1. Top Header Section

Main Title: "Filters" (Bold, white, aligned left, slightly larger font).

Divider: A subtle horizontal line (dark grey) below "Filters".

Map Selector: A map icon followed by the text "STELLA MONTIS" in all caps, bold, white.

Layer Controls: * Text label: "Layer:" (grey).

Next to it, a toggle button group with the options: "Bottom Floor", "Top Floor", "Show All", "Hide All".

These buttons have a dark background, lighter text, and act as active/inactive toggles.

2. List Categories (Accordions)
Each category acts as a collapsible section.

Category Header Styling: Contains a specific icon on the far left, followed by the category name in a bright cyan/blue color (e.g., #00b4d8), followed by a tracker fraction in smaller text (e.g., (7/7)).

List Item Styling: Indented slightly under the header. Each item has a specific white/grey vector icon on the left, followed by the item name in light grey text. There are no traditional checkboxes; clicking the entire row toggles its active state (usually indicated by making the icon/text brighter or dimming it when turned off).

3. Exact Content and Icon Structure (Top to Bottom)

Category: Points of Interest (7 / 7)

Header Icon: Map pin with a dot inside.

Items:

Icon: Tray with an upward arrow -> Player Spawn

Icon: (Standard point icon) -> Raider Hatch

Icon: Tray with a downward arrow -> Cargo Elevator

Icon: (Standard point icon) -> Quest

Icon: Radio antenna tower -> Supply Call Station

Icon: (Standard point icon) -> Field Depot

Icon: Box with a globe/arrow graphic -> Field Crate

Category: Containers (18 / 18)

